            320,
            48,
            '{"parser": "legacy-migration", "file_name": "הצעת בניית תוכנית עבודה לשימוש במוצר.docx", "file_type": "docx", "legacyData": {"legacy_id": "6079c17e-988e-4aa7-b800-195ac9926d44", "external_id": null, "collection": "collection", "type": "chunk-data", "tags": "", "user_id": "c54aad3b1a0cba4027f315540112f7fd", "create_date": "2026-01-12T20:38:23.976Z", "link_to_file": "https://jeenfilesdevweu.blob.core.windows.net/jeendocs/c54aad3b1a0cba4027f315540112f7fd/data/1768250298610-הצעת בניית תוכנית עבודה לשימוש במוצר.docx", "excerptKeywords": "KEYWORDS: בסיס עבודה, יישום מערכת, למידה הדרגתית, ניהול יעיל, חברת החשמל"}}'::jsonb,
            '2026-01-12T20:38:23.976000+00:00',
            $TRANS$The purpose of the document is to serve as an orderly and agreed-upon basis for the implementation of the system at IEC, in a way that will ensure gradual learning, optimal integration of the tools in the organizational systems, and effective management of the implementation and development process. The work plan and the main stagesThe following is a list of the components of the plan, the main stages for implementation, and the expected outcomes at each stage of the implementation process of the Jeen system at the IEC.$TRANS$
