            '2026-01-12T20:39:12.985000+00:00',
            $TRANS$The system will be based on artificial intelligence tools and will provide a convenient and efficient work interface. The solution includes three main components: centralization of information for the treating party - automatic retrieval of medical information, eligibility and operations from various systems and processing them using artificial intelligence. The information will be presented in an accessible and clear manner, while emphasizing data that may affect the decision, such as: arriving at the emergency room on a holiday, performing exceptional tests, unusual waiting times with the nurses' hotline, and more. Recommendation and Draft Response to the Applicant - The system produces a data-based recommendation on whether to approve or reject the application, based on the information collected and the entitlements that have been checked.$TRANS$
        );
