            '{"parser": "legacy-migration", "file_name": "מסמך אפיון.docx", "file_type": "docx", "legacyData": {"legacy_id": "a0c59279-7d67-4346-ba20-69ad4bc45263", "external_id": null, "collection": "collection", "type": "chunk-data", "tags": "", "user_id": "c54aad3b1a0cba4027f315540112f7fd", "create_date": "2026-01-12T20:39:12.999Z", "link_to_file": "https://jeenfilesdevweu.blob.core.windows.net/jeendocs/c54aad3b1a0cba4027f315540112f7fd/data/1768250322792-מסמך אפיון.docx", "excerptKeywords": "KEYWORDS: מערכת, נתונים, פרמטרים, מוקד, המלצה"}}'::jsonb,
            '2026-01-12T20:39:12.999000+00:00',
            $TRANS$The system takes all the data it has collected from the various systems and highlights the parameters that should be paid attention to. For example: if the friend called the call center at night or on the weekend, if he waited a long time in the emergency room, if a doctor recommended that he go to the emergency room, or if he had special tests. All of these things are presented clearly and conveniently, so you can see what happened and decide easily. In addition, the system is based on the information, and the procedures detailed below give a recommendation for the decision.$TRANS$
