            $TRANS$Photo: Interface Components: The option to edit the letter directly in the free text interface (Canvas), in a simple and convenient way. A sidebar that allows you to talk to the model – to ask for rewriting, to correct formulations, or to ask for clarifications – all in natural language. Button to download the letter version as a PDF file. Like/Dislike field and leaving a free response on the quality of the response or information – for the purposes of improvement and control.$TRANS$
