            '2026-01-12T20:39:38.241000+00:00',
            $TRANS$Process Description: (High-Level Flow) The process begins as soon as an application is categorized in the CRM system as a request for a refund for a visit to the emergency room and is given a status of "under treatment". From this point, an automated AI-based process is triggered that collects the required information, analyzes it, and creates a draft response tailored to the applicant. Step 1: Receive the Request The system automatically identifies the relevant request and receives the full details of the application, content, and attached documents as entered into the CRM system.$TRANS$
