            '{"parser": "legacy-migration", "file_name": "מסמך אפיון.docx", "file_type": "docx", "legacyData": {"legacy_id": "7a41f29a-1bec-4654-9362-120faab09ae7", "external_id": null, "collection": "collection", "type": "chunk-data", "tags": "", "user_id": "c54aad3b1a0cba4027f315540112f7fd", "create_date": "2026-01-12T20:39:38.257Z", "link_to_file": "https://jeenfilesdevweu.blob.core.windows.net/jeendocs/c54aad3b1a0cba4027f315540112f7fd/data/1768250372375-מסמך אפיון.docx", "excerptKeywords": "KEYWORDS: אישור משטרה, תאונת דרכים, ביקור במיון, גיליון שחרור, תאונת תלמיד"}}'::jsonb,
            '2026-01-12T20:39:38.257000+00:00',
            $TRANS$The exemption will be given upon presentation of a police permit for a road accident - a visit to the emergency room within 3-7 days from the date of the accident. The exemption will be granted on condition that the need for a visit stems from the accident. A certificate from the police is required in which the member is listed as the victim of the accident, as well as a release sheet from the car accident emergency room - visit to the emergency room from the 8th day after the accident onwards: the exemption will be granted on condition that the reason for the visit stems from the accident, and only in the case where the other members are obligated to pay a fee (visit to the emergency room from 23:00 at night to 6:00 am, or in the event that there was a medical justification for visiting the emergency room for a student-student who was injured at school or on a school trip).$TRANS$
        );
