            '2026-01-12T20:57:54.735000+00:00',
            $TRANS$Consumption data divided into low and peak hours according to the relevant clusters of work hours;  For consumers with a smart prepayment meter - viewing the amount of money and kWh remaining in the meter, presenting an expectation of the end of the balance according to current usage, and activating the "friendly credit" when the existing balance ends. A default provider will allow its users in the application all of the services listed below, at least: reporting the meter reading as of the date of the request and the possibility of generating the account;  updating a fixed payment method and a one-time payment option;  Consumers with a smart prepayment meter will be able to make a payment in favor of the surplus to use.$TRANS$
