            '2026-01-12T20:57:54.778000+00:00',
            $TRANS$Advance bills based on an estimate – a monthly electricity bill at the request of a registered consumer who receives a bi-monthly bill, the essential service provider will send him one-month advance bills based on an estimate in accordance with the previous consumption bill, as long as the consumer has not informed him of his desire to return to receiving bi-monthly bills. Information regarding this service will be made available to consumers on the consumption bill. This section will not apply to consumers who have a smart meter installed. Delivery to a special address A registered consumer may request a one-time delivery of an account to a special address provided by the essential service provider.$TRANS$
