            '2026-01-12T20:57:54.740000+00:00',
            $TRANS$The essential service provider will send the consumer a new consumption bill that includes a notice regarding a previous consumption debt; The essential service provider will send the consumer a notice of the production of the bill and the debt by digital means that the consumer has provided to the essential service provider contact details with him through him for this purpose, and if he has not provided him with such a means – by mail;    At least 52 days have passed from the last date of payment of the first bill sent regarding the debt, an essential service provider will send an additional notice to the consumer regarding the debt to the telephone, if the mobile phone number is registered with the essential service provider; The notice will allow the consumer to receive an immediate response at the service center;$TRANS$
