            $TRANS$(a) The essential service provider shall send a consumer bill to a registered consumer associated in the books of an essential service provider to a bi-monthly account approximately once every two months, for the current months preceding the date of sending the bill, and to a registered consumer associated in the books of an essential service provider to a one-month account approximately once a month, for the current month preceding the date the bill was sent; The essential service provider may send a registered consumer a consumption account for a shorter bill period; (b) An essential service provider will send the consumption bill within 5 working days from the date the consumption meter is called, and if the meter is not read, from the end of the period for which the bill can be submitted;$TRANS$
