            84,
            '{"parser": "legacy-migration", "file_name": "אמות מידה קצר - בדיקות.docx", "file_type": "docx", "legacyData": {"legacy_id": "a54665c8-d172-4248-903e-b61c5de5a75a", "external_id": null, "collection": "collection", "type": "chunk-data", "tags": "", "user_id": "c54aad3b1a0cba4027f315540112f7fd", "create_date": "2026-01-12T20:57:54.801Z", "link_to_file": "https://jeenfilesdevweu.blob.core.windows.net/jeendocs/c54aad3b1a0cba4027f315540112f7fd/data/1768251429504-אמות מידה קצר - בדיקות.docx", "excerptKeywords": "KEYWORDS: ועדת החריגים, רשם הוצאה לפועל, חדלות פירעון, נציג ציבור, עובד סוציאלי"}}'::jsonb,
            '2026-01-12T20:57:54.801000+00:00',
            $TRANS$The Exceptions Committee will be composed of five members as detailed below: a retired Registrar of Execution or a retired Magistrate's Court judge who has experience in insolvency, or the Commissioner of Insolvency Proceedings and Retired Economic Rehabilitation, who will be the Chairman of the Committee;      A senior employee of the essential service provider, who is qualified to be a lawyer in accordance with Section 24 of the Bar Association Law, 5721-1961;      a public representative with medical training;      A public representative who is qualified to be a social worker under Section 9 of the Social Workers Law, 5756-1996, and who has a background and knowledge in the field of working with needy populations;$TRANS$
