            '{"parser": "legacy-migration", "file_name": "אמות מידה קצר - בדיקות.docx", "file_type": "docx", "legacyData": {"legacy_id": "d7fdb7d3-88e0-4f87-b13a-1ac46111026f", "external_id": null, "collection": "collection", "type": "chunk-data", "tags": "", "user_id": "c54aad3b1a0cba4027f315540112f7fd", "create_date": "2026-01-12T20:57:54.702Z", "link_to_file": "https://jeenfilesdevweu.blob.core.windows.net/jeendocs/c54aad3b1a0cba4027f315540112f7fd/data/1768251429504-אמות מידה קצר - בדיקות.docx", "excerptKeywords": "KEYWORDS: מקומות הצרכנות, תעריף ביתי, צריכה שנתית, ספק השירות, אמינות אספקה"}}'::jsonb,
            '2026-01-12T20:57:54.702000+00:00',
            $TRANS$As well as information about all the places of consumption registered in his name that are charged with a home tariff, including the address of the place of consumption, the tariff of the kWh in which the place of consumption was charged, the total annual consumption in kWh, the total annual payment for each of the places of consumption separately, the total number of minutes of non-supply based on the information contained in the books of the essential service provider on the high-voltage line that feeds the place of consumption, and in accordance with average supply reliability indices estimated according to the three years prior to the date of production of the information.$TRANS$
