            '2026-01-12T20:57:54.843000+00:00',
            $TRANS$Regarding consumption debt at a household rate, the following provisions will apply: within 7 days from the deadline for payment of the bill, an essential service provider will send a text message to the consumer about the debt, if the consumer's mobile phone number is registered with the essential service provider; The notice will allow the consumer to receive a response at the service center;    At least 10 days have passed after the deadline for payment of the bill and the consumer has not paid the bill, the essential service provider will send the consumer a first notice for the repayment of the debt, on which the word "alert" is written in Hebrew, Arabic, Russian and Amharic; The essential service provider will send the alert by mail or e-mail,$TRANS$
