            $TRANS$A consumer who is indebted to a flat household tariff, a consumer who is liable to a flat rate that is not a household and a smart meter holder, will also be presented with a comparative summary at the end of the year of their consumption cost, approximately, if they were charged at a time load rate (TAOZ) and not a uniform tariff;  Attached to the account, the information as stated in clause (b)(1)(g) will be brought to the consumer's attention;  Additional notices in accordance with the Authority's guidelines on consumer matters, from time to time. 23A. Receipt of information and services digitally Chapter Benchmark Mark Beginning Decision Date Meeting Decision Status B: Electricity Consumption A: Bills and Payments 23A.$TRANS$
