            '2026-01-12T20:57:54.787000+00:00',
            $TRANS$Consumer Network Services An essential service provider will make the network services available to all electricity consumers, whether they receive a supply service from the essential service provider or a supply service from a supplier. Attached from March to April, each year, the Essential Service Provider will send a notice to the consumer with a breakdown of annual charges, including a summary of the amounts charged by the consumer in the calendar year preceding the date the notice was issued, including charges that were not paid by the consumer by the date the notice was sent. For unpaid charges, a separate highlighted line will be assigned in the message.$TRANS$
