            $TRANS$Use Cases Table – Customer Inquiries Regarding Electricity Bill Number Number of Use Cases Use Cases Description 1 1.0 High Electricity Bill – A specific invoice or any figure on the invoice The customer reports a high bill and provides information for a specific invoice: official number/billing period/amount to be paid/total consumption/bill date/reference to a specific invoice. 2 2.0 High Electricity Bill – Without reference to a specific invoice, the customer reports a high bill but does not provide any details on the basis of which the inquiry can be linked to a specific invoice or a specific billing period. Case Management0. 1High Electricity Bill – Specific Invoice A. Invoice Locating We will locate the relevant invoice from the invoice screen, according to the data specified by the customer in the complaint, official number, billing period, amount to be paid, billing date, reference to a specific invoice or total consumption. Based on the field that appears in the application, we will identify the appropriate invoice for further processing. System meter test 1. A test will be performed in the system for the purpose of locating a meter test that has been performed on the customer over the past three years. The test status and results will be displayed to the delegate on the UI screen 2.$TRANS$
