            '2026-01-12T21:12:01.573000+00:00',
            $TRANS$A check will be performed in the system in the "Service Notices" window in order to locate a meter check that was performed in the last three years for the customer if no meter test was found during this period: the customer must be informed of his right to a free meter check once every three years. To redeem it, you can contact the IEC's 103 hotline on the website, via chat or the digital form at the following link: https://www.iec.co.il/pages/reqnoident.aspx. If a meter test was found to have been performed (status completed) in the last three years, it is necessary to verify the status: If a meter test (Z8) that was performed (status completed) was found – this must be explicitly stated in a letter to the customer, including the test result. (The method of testing appears in the screenshots below) If the customer is interested in testing an additional meter for a fee, it should be offered.$TRANS$
        );
