            '2026-01-12T21:12:01.574000+00:00',
            $TRANS$Wording: If you wish for an additional test in accordance with the rules stated in the criteria, you can order for a fee by contacting the IEC's 103 hotline at the link https://www.iec.co.il/pages/reqnoident.aspx If there is an open status (performance/work), it should be noted in the response that there is an open request that will be handled as soon as possible.  It appears that on the __________ day your request for a meter check was received, upon completion of the processing of the application, the IEC will act as much as necessary to amend the consumption bill, in accordance with the findings of the examination. If the meter is in a canceled/canceled status – the agent will write a message to the handling representative D. Checking the type of meter We will perform a test to identify the type of meter of the customer – smart meter or basic meter. If the "Smart Counter" field does not appear at all, it is a basic (not smart) counter. (There may be a situation in which the customer has a smart counter, but the call will be by a doubt since there is a malfunction in the meter and we asked to move it to a reading track by a meter reader) • If the field "Smart Counter" is "There is a smart counter" it is a smart meter.$TRANS$
        );
    END IF;
