            '2026-01-12T21:12:01.566000+00:00',
            $TRANS$If there is no change exceeding 20% (inclusive), the customer will be informed in the response that the average daily consumption is similar to that of a similar period in the previous year. - What is the wording you want?Wording: A test we conducted shows that the average daily value in the invoice for which you applied is similar to the average daily value for a similar period in the previous year. Another possible wording: An examination we conducted shows that the amount of consumption in the invoice for which you made a request is similar to the amount of consumption in a similar period in previous years, for example: the average daily usage for an invoice dated 9.25 is 82 kWh, compared to 78 kWh in invoice 7.24 and 74.5 kWh in invoice 9.23. *To the extent possible that the system will be able to identify a case such as a deviation of more than 20%, is there a possibility of selecting the nature of the response, i.e. 2 choice boxes, and according to what will be marked by the employee, the system will issue a wording accordingly. IV.$TRANS$
