            '{"parser": "legacy-migration", "file_name": "אפיון עסקי - בדיקות מוצר.docx", "file_type": "docx", "legacyData": {"legacy_id": "6ffbeb94-0af4-4d45-afb7-3f819d4025b8", "external_id": null, "collection": "collection", "type": "chunk-data", "tags": "", "user_id": "c54aad3b1a0cba4027f315540112f7fd", "create_date": "2026-01-12T21:12:01.568Z", "link_to_file": "https://jeenfilesdevweu.blob.core.windows.net/jeendocs/c54aad3b1a0cba4027f315540112f7fd/data/1768252310218-אפיון עסקי - בדיקות מוצר.docx", "excerptKeywords": "KEYWORDS: קריאה אמיתית, חישוב, צריכה, חשבונית, תקופה מקבילה"}}'::jsonb,
            '2026-01-12T21:12:01.568000+00:00',
            $TRANS$If the corresponding period was a real reading, we will perform a calculation using the following formula in order to check that there was indeed no deviation (if we do not move to section D)Total consumption of the invoice from the corresponding period / billing days in the corresponding period = the average monthly daily consumption in the corresponding period (a new figure that you get in the calculation of the corresponding period) Then we will multiply the average daily consumption of the corresponding invoice by the number of billing days on the invoice that the customer complained about and compare this against the actual average daily consumption in the invoice in order to If a change of more than X% in consumption is detected compared to the corresponding period, the following wording will be added: (The customer will be offered to report a meter reading) The system will automatically generate a message to the responsible human entity, for the purpose of examining and confirming that there has indeed been a drastic change in the customer's consumption compared to the previous year. And in any case, he will be offered to report an updated reading, we would be happy for a clearer wording, d. A complaint about a specific invoice whose reading type is not true and the type of reading in the invoice in the corresponding period is also unreal.$TRANS$
        );
