            $TRANS$Retrieval of relevant information and a draft smart response to the applicant: The system automatically retrieves the relevant information from various sources according to the type of inquiry and context, processes it and produces a full, accurate and uniform response letter on the basis of it. The draft is presented to the department's representative for review, editing, and approval before sending, thus maintaining uniformity in wording and the style of communication with the public, while ensuring compliance with organizational policy. Admin Dashboard: An administrative interface that displays an up-to-date picture of all references - it is required to define and characterize the graphs you want to see in the admin screen (open task). Target AudienceEmployees of the Public Complaints Unit in the field of supply and high electricity bills at the IEC, alongside managerial and operational entities involved in the service and control processes. The process of assimilation. Initial Pilot: Conducting a pilot for a limited number of users (the number must be set to 10 users), for the purpose of examining the system's performance in a real environment, identifying gaps, and collecting initial feedback from users.$TRANS$
