            $TRANS$(Text should be sent) (Appears below in an internal message to the representative) It should be noted in the response to the customer that there is an open request that is being processed (a version must be sent) Wording: In accordance with what is stated in the criteria, the consumer has the option of checking the meter free of charge once every three years, from our record it appears that on the ________ day your request to perform a meter check was received, upon completion of the processing of the application, the IEC will act as long as it is necessary to amend the consumption bill, in accordance with the findings of the examination. The agent will present an internal notice to the treating representative for further treatment and to examine the need for further action. Please note that there is an open service notice that has not yet been placed, make sure that not much time has passed since it was opened, and if necessary, contact the meter testing department for promotion 4. If there is a meter check with the status of "canceled/canceled": the agent will present an internal message to the treating representative for the purpose of further treatment and to examine the need for additional action, in addition to offering a response to the customer. 5. If no meter tests have been found at all in the last 3 years: The customer should be offered the option to perform a meter test free of charge.$TRANS$
