            $TRANS$There is a file that says which URLs are not indexed. The sixth step is what we learned in the previous lesson, that we would like to see if the new document is almost similar to what I already have, so we will perform the algorithm that we performed last week. It is possible that all the parts will pass in a certain way at the same time. Streamline the crawler with the amount of information available today, it is impossible for a single computer, no matter how powerful it is, to do all the work. So the crawler and the architecture that we have seen will also be distributed among the crawlers. In other words, one computer will not do all this work. How will we carry out decentralization?$TRANS$
