            $TRANS$Then we will check with the rest of the data to see if the formula works well – we will change the formula so that the distance will be reduced – testing the model using new samples – the rest of the data, in order to check the accuracy.    For example, each document has two areas: a header (T) and a body (B). We will mark the heading and the body as a Boolean correspondence function: the value of the function is equal to 1 when there is a correspondence and 0 when there is no correspondence.$TRANS$
