            '2025-08-26T11:29:00.317000+00:00',
            $TRANS$Conversely, if there is a pair of real numbers (a1, a2), there is a single point in plane A that corresponds to that pair. The ship can be described as a point or as a vector (which has a direction). Each point in the plane has one vector and vice versa, each vector has its own point and its own henya. Vector Documents and Queries As we said, a vector is characterized by length and orientation. We will represent the documents as vectors in space. We will represent the query as a vector in space. We will rank the documents according to the proximity of their vectors to the vector of the query. How do you define vector space? One option is to use a Euclidean distance.$TRANS$
