            '2025-08-26T11:29:00.329000+00:00',
            $TRANS$Finally, we will get the score of the distance between the query and the document – the greater the score, the closer the query to the document. Classification of Masses of Documents We will go over the pseudocode – when there is a query we will want to calculate cos N = Total Documents 1. We will create an N-size array for grades 2. We will create an array of lengths of magnitude N. 3. We have a query and for each query we will check the concept t. 4. We will perform the calculation by using a posting list (inverted index, i.e. each word in which document) and not a frequency matrix structure.$TRANS$
