            '2025-08-26T11:29:00.356000+00:00',
            $TRANS$If there are different search engines that I am comparing, it is possible to generate graphs and compare them to each other, which of them reaches the ideal point (Slide 20).     Precision Curve -verage RecallA We will perform an average calculation beyond a lot of queries. Each standard point of recall is considered an average. We will draw a graph as we did in the previous slides. We will make a comparison between different search engines. The white dots represent the real measurements in relation to the line, the farther away the dots, the lower the chance that the dot will fall on the line.$TRANS$
