            $TRANS$Vectors are sparse vectors – meaning that the values in most dimensions will be equal to zero. Vector space – reminder We will denote in n R the set of all the ships of real numbers. Liner (n-ya)- For any natural n, a liner of real numbers is a collection of n real numbers, not necessarily different from each other, plus their order. is the length of the ship. The dimension of (,...,) 1n aDD= − I did enact Julius Caesar I was killed i' the Capitol;   Brutus killed me. So let it be with  Caesar.$TRANS$
