            $TRANS$g*S B (d,q)+p*S T (d,q) The goal is to study the weights that produce a rating for the document, so that we improve our formula (optimize) according to the results obtained, so that we change g and p accordingly. Take the words from the documents and perform Parsing Linguistics. Document cash – displays the summary of the document (like a Google search shows us). At the same time, there is the query on which the parser and spell correction processes are also performed, and on which spell correction is performed. We'll do indexing and then scoring and ranking (using indexing and machine learning).$TRANS$
