            '2025-08-26T11:29:00.246000+00:00',
            $TRANS$We will sort through the memory of the parts. We will define the size of the block that we read from the disk according to the size of the main memory, so that each time we upload a small section to memory, sort it and return it to the disk. We will then merge the sorted blocks. n holds the number of blocks. We have documents that have not yet been processed and we want to start reading the words from it, the documents are on a disk, we will read a block of data from a document and we will retrieve the concepts. We will read the documents until the block is filled, if the document is larger than the block size, we will read part of it.$TRANS$
