            $TRANS$Representation of the document • Representation of the entire text and keeping it in memory does not make sense in terms of quantity. • We saw that if we had made a full match, there would have been no problem because we would have only saved the signature in memory. • Can the same idea be used? Yes. Let's illustrate the following model, we have a document and we want to represent it in a certain way. We will take the document and divide it into groups of letters or words, and in these groups we will create signatures. We will compare the set of signatures that have been created.$TRANS$
