            '2025-08-26T11:29:00.245000+00:00',
            $TRANS$We divided into two groups: - First group a-f. We add another letter z to the upper limit and we get the limit a-fz. - Second group g-m. An additional letter A is added to the lower limit and we get the ga-m boundary. • Suppose we have reached the maaaa-mzzzz range, i.e. all words that begin with the letter m.$TRANS$
