            $TRANS$When there is a query, we will search both indexes and merge. From time to time we will reindex all did-d1 enact-d1 Caesar-d1 capitol-d1 Brutus-d1 a-e i-d1 Julius-d1 i-d1 i-d1 f-j killed-d1 me-d1 k-o the-d1 p-t was-d1 u-z data. We will hold a vector to save the deleted documents. There are drawbacks to this approach, mergers that are often carried out cause the process to be slow, while mergers are time-consuming. Especially if the main index is saved in a lot of files.$TRANS$
