            '2025-08-26T11:29:00.308000+00:00',
            $TRANS$We will get a count vector whose length is the number of terms in the dictionary. Frequency of Term Frequency We will mark team frequency as t,d tf We would like to represent the following argument: a concept that is found 10 times in a document is more relevant than a concept that is found only once, but not ten times more (i.e. that a concept is found 100 times or 10 times means that the document is 10 times more relevant than the second document, the intention is not in a proportional sense). Therefore, we will use a logarithm to reduce the effect, the larger the number it increases, but not in a linear way, but at a more moderate rate.$TRANS$
        );
