            '2025-08-26T11:29:00.287000+00:00',
            $TRANS$There is a faster way: replacement of first character → rorse removal of third charchter → rose Removal of last character → ros recursion in Hebrew means regression or recursion, this is a phenomenon whose every occurrence contains an additional instance of it. In the field of programming, it is a well-known technique whose essence is a function that calls itself. There are many problems for which a recursive solution is simpler than an iterative solution (using loops). Rules: • Assume that you know how to solve the previous step. • All that remains is to solve the last step (usually the last step is a problem that is easier to solve).$TRANS$
