            '2025-08-26T11:29:00.298000+00:00',
            $TRANS$We will create blocks on the disk, we are presented with two documents, for the example the block size will be 8 pairs. Let's start reading the document and build 8 pairs: (a pair consists of a word and the document number) and get the following sorted blocks (the block can contain words from both documents): Merge sort-sort M Merge merging two sorted arrays is a simple task. Let's try to merge the following two sorted arrays: Let's look at the first element in each array, the smallest of which will be the smallest element in the merged array. The complexity of merging two blocks is the length of the two lists.$TRANS$
